id: EVT6-8
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: tick_progress
target: crates/core/src/tick.rs
find:         return ignored(&state.run, &outcome.detail);
replace:         return ignored(&state.run, &outcome.detail).into_iter().chain(ignored(&state.run, &outcome.detail)).collect();
expect-fail: mismatched_tick_records_one_ignored
expect-fail: duplicate_index_advances_once
expect-fail: p2_mismatched_tick_keeps_run
note: 無視を 2 件記録する（「1 件だけ」の違反）
